! use Alt + Z para ver contenido correctamente(View > Word Wrap):
!! how to change FONTS in packet tracer:
! options > preferences > Font >
! Size: otros textos en general
! CLI: es para la terminal/console

!! how to connect with CONSOLE cable (out-of-band access method):
! > Connections > click Console cable > in the PC conect it to the RS-232 port > and on the Network device conect it the "console port"

!! how to open cisco's CLI/TERMINAL/console(packet tracer):
! > open PC > Desktop > Terminal > OK > press ENTER key

!! how to set up IP ADDRESS in PC (End devices)
! open PC > Desktop > ip configuration > configure:
        !* ipv4 ADDRESS
        !* submask
        !* default gateway

!! how to see INTERFACE name in packet tracer:
! Options > preferences > interface > check "always show port label in logical workspace"